      "body": {
        "serial": "container_containeritembody_5e984c281b295809535850",
        "body": "\n    <p id=\"stimulus\">\n            During more than 30 years, the American Space Shuttle transported 355 astronauts in space over 135\n            orbital launchings from Cap Canaveral, Florida. This 2046-ton Behemoth traveled 870 million kilometers\n            around the Earth from 12th of April 1981 to 21st of July 2011. The National Aeronautics and Space\n            Administration (NASA) built 5 Space Shuttles: Columbia, Challenger, Discovery, Atlantis and Endeavour.\n\t\t<\/p>\n    {{interaction_choiceinteraction_5e984c281b582126934134}}\n  ",
